    {
      "id": "phase-overview",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Phase Overview",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Yama fights in two beats: a standard pressure phase, then an apparition phase where he vanishes and a sequence of apparitions resolves to a final safe position before a full-arena burst.",
        "The kill is only step one of a longer reward chain — do not expect the passive points at the moment of death."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Beat 1: standard pressure.",
        "Beat 2: apparition -> safe spot -> burst.",
        "Kill is step one of the chain."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "apparition-mechanic",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Apparition Mechanic",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 4,
      "paragraphs": [
        "During the apparition phase Yama disappears and several apparitions respond in sequence. A final safe position appears; move to it (or use verified line-of-sight) before the full-arena burst, then he returns.",
        "The sequence is readable: each apparition points toward the next safe area. Do not stand still — follow the safe position."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Yama vanishes, apparitions resolve.",
        "Final safe position appears.",
        "Move there before the burst."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-of-sight-guide",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Line-of-Sight Guide",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 5,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Pillars in the Halls of the Dead provide line-of-sight cover during the apparition burst. Using a pillar is a stable tactic on the current patch when the safe spot is the pillar LoS.",
        "Do not assume pillar-hiding works blindly across patches — verify on the current client. The explosion is telegraphed and dodgeable regardless."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Pillars give verified LoS cover.",
        "Stable on current patch for pillar safe spot.",
        "Verify per patch; explosion is telegraphed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "arena-state",
      "type": "arena",
      "title": "Arena and Hazards",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 6,
      "paragraphs": [
        "The Halls of the Dead arena has pillars you use for line-of-sight and a center that becomes dangerous during the apparition burst. The indicated safe circle can be hard to read — trust the pillar LoS if the circle is unclear.",
        "Keep mobile; the full-arena burst punishes standing in the open."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Pillars = LoS cover.",
        "Center dangerous during burst.",
        "Trust pillar LoS if circle unclear."
      ]
    },
