    {
      "id": "reward-claim-flow",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Reward Claim Flow (Trial Chain)",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 9,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Beating Yama drops the Silver Coin. The Silver Coin starts the Trial of the Ancestors; after completing the trial (via Navali / Hinekora flow) you receive the Tattoo of Hinekora, which grants +2 Weapon Set Passive Skill Points when used.",
        "The passive points are NOT from the kill alone. Each step is separate: Yama -> Silver Coin -> Trial -> Tattoo -> +2 Points."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Beat Yama -> Silver Coin drops.",
        "Silver Coin -> Trial of the Ancestors.",
        "Trial -> Tattoo of Hinekora.",
        "Use Tattoo -> +2 Weapon Set Passive Points."
      ]
    },
