      "type": "build-considerations",
      "title": "Build Considerations",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 11,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Yama is a mechanic fight more than a DPS race. Respect the apparition burst with line-of-sight and the kill becomes manageable for any build.",
        "Melee can punish Phase 1 windows; ranged should hold mid range and use pillars for the burst. HC players should learn the safe spot before committing."
      ],
      "bullets": [
